<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page qd-theme qd-diary"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="heading">我的一日三餐</view><view class="subtitle">{{date}} · 记录好好吃饭的自己</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><view class="empty">登录后查看自己的餐食记录</view><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">登录 / 完善资料</button></view><block wx:else><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">好好吃饭</text><button class="link" data-url="/pages/records/index?type=meal&date={{date}}" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/edit.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>＋ 记一餐</text></button></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{mealGroups}}" wx:key="key"><view class="row"><view class="row start"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/{{item.icon}}.svg"/><text class="title">{{item.label}}</text></view><text class="small-text">{{item.total}} kcal</text></view><view wx:if="{{!item.records.length}}" class="meal-empty">还没有记录，记下认真吃饭的自己。</view><view wx:for="{{item.records}}" wx:for-item="record" wx:key="id" class="record-row"><image wx:if="{{record.imagePath}}" class="thumb" mode="aspectFill" src="{{record.imagePath}}"/><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{record.name}}</view><text class="small-text">{{record.kcal}} kcal · {{record.source === 'recognition' ? '模拟识餐' : '手动记录'}}</text></view><button class="delete" data-id="{{record.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view><button wx:if="{{date === today}}" class="btn soft mt entry-home" data-url="/pages/photo/index" bindtap="go"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/camera.svg"/>拍照，记下这一餐</button></view>
<view class="footnote">早餐、午餐、晚餐和加餐，都是照顾自己的日常。</view></block></block></view>